
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">With which universities have APA Presidents been affiliated?</p>



<span id="more-27040"></span>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://joshuapaschal.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Joshua Paschal</a>, a recent philosophy PhD out of Indiana University Bloomington, took up that question, gathered the data, and discusses it in the guest post, below.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">It&#8217;s a look at one kind of the institutional history of philosophy in the United States, one that may inform or complement our understanding of the sociology of the profession.</p>



